    "preamble": "Ram Dulare vs Sri Murli Manohar Lal Commissioner Food ... on 29 January, 2024 High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Neutral Citation No. - 2024:Ahc-Lko:8141 Court No. - 19 Case :- Contempt Application (Civil) No. - 1539 of 2016 Applicant :- Ram Dulare Opposite Party :- Sri Murli Manohar Lal Commissioner Food Safety And Drug Admini Counsel for Applicant :- Indrapal Singh Hon'ble Shree Prakash Singh,J. Case called out. None present for the petitioners, whereas, Sri Sunil Bajpai, learned Additional Chief Standing Counsel appearing for the State submits that the order dated 27-04-2016, passed by the writ court has been complied with in it's letter and spirit. In view of aforesaid, no contempt is made out.",
